general_comments.body:
Thank you @ashsearle for the support!

@raghavmac yeah, basically this is not a simple issue. The only sane way to support this is for each locale to define which days it considers weekend. I won't be surprised if there are non-consecutive weekends as well.

So if you want to use this in your codebase you can simply "monkey patch" moment and hope it will only be used for locales where weekends are actually Sat/Sun.

